# IMPLEMENTATION OF PROTECTION FOR VICTIMS OF GENDER-BASED VIOLENCE AND CHILDREN

REGIONAL GAZETTE

NUMBER 2 YEAR 2013

# REGIONAL REGULATION OF KUDUS REGENCY

NUMBER 2 YEAR

CONCERNING

IMPLEMENTATION OF PROTECTION FOR VICTIMS OF GENDER-BASED VIOLENCE AND CHILDREN

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

THE REGENT OF KUDUS,

Considering:







a. that all forms of violence, especially gender-based violence and violence against children are violations of human rights and crimes against human dignity as well as forms of discrimination;
b. that victims of gender-based violence and children must receive protection, both from the Regional Government, related agencies, and/or the community in order to be protected and free from violence and/or threats of violence in the household and community;
c. that based on Law Number 23 Year 2002 concerning Child Protection and Law Number 23 Year 2004 concerning the Elimination of Domestic Violence, the Regional Government, related agencies, and/or the community are obligated to undertake prevention, protection, and recovery efforts for victims of gender-based violence and children;
d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b, and letter c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning the Implementation of Protection for Victims of Gender-Based Violence and Children;

In View of:







1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
2. Law Number 13 Year 1950 concerning the Establishment of Regency Regions within the Province of Central Java;
3. Law Number 4 Year 1979 concerning Child Welfare (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1979 Number 32, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3143);
4. Law Number 39 Year 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1999 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3886);
5. Law Number 23 Year 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2002 Number 109, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4235);
6. Law Number 13 Year 2003 concerning Manpower (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2003 Number 39, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4281);
7. Law Number 23 Year 2004 concerning the Elimination of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2004 Number 95, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4419);
8. Law Number 32 Year 2004 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2004 Number 125, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4437 as amended several times most recently by Law Number 12 Year 2008 concerning the Second Amendment to Law Number 32 Year 2004 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2008 Number 59, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4844);
9. Law Number 13 Year 2006 concerning Protection of Witnesses and Victims (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2006 Number 64, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4635);
10. Law Number 21 Year 2007 concerning the Eradication of the Criminal Act of Trafficking in Persons (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2007 Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4720);
11. Law Number 11 Year 2009 concerning Social Welfare (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2009 Number 12, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4967);
12. Law Number 36 Year 2009 concerning Health (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2009 Number 144, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5063);
13. Law Number 12 Year 2011 concerning the Formulation of Legislation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2011 Number 82, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5234);
14. Law Number 11 Year 2012 concerning the Juvenile Criminal Justice System (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2012 Number 153, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5332);
15. Government Regulation Number 2 Year 1988 concerning Child Welfare Efforts for Children with Problems (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1988 Number 2, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia 3367);
16. Government Regulation Number 6 Year 1988 concerning Coordination of Vertical Agency Activities in the Regions (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1988 Number 10, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia 3373);
17. Government Regulation Number 79 Year 2005 concerning Guidelines for the Development and Supervision of Regional Government Administration (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2005 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4593);
18. Government Regulation Number 4 Year 2006 concerning the Implementation and Cooperation for the Recovery of Victims of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2006 Number 15 Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4604);
19. Government Regulation Number 38 Year 2007 concerning the Division of Government Affairs Between the Government, Provincial Regional Government, and Regency/City Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2007 Number 82, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4737);
20. Government Regulation Number 50 Year 2007 concerning Procedures for the Implementation of Regional Cooperation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2007 Number 112, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4761);
21. Government Regulation Number 9 Year 2008 concerning Procedures and Mechanisms for Integrated Services for Witnesses and/or Victims of the Criminal Act of Trafficking in Persons (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2008 Number 22, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4818);
22. Presidential Regulation Number 1 Year 2007 concerning Ratification, Promulgation and Dissemination of Legislation;
23. Regional Regulation of Central Java Province Number 3 Year 2009 concerning the Implementation of Protection for Victims of Gender-Based Violence and Children (Provincial Regional Gazette Year 2009 Number 3, Supplement to the Regional Gazette of Central Java Province Number 20);
24. Regional Regulation of Kudus Regency Number 3 Year 2008 concerning Government Affairs that are the Authority of the Regional Government of Kudus Regency (Regional Gazette of Kudus Regency Year 2008 Number 3, Supplement to the Regional Gazette of Kudus Regency Number 106);

With Mutual Approval

REGIONAL HOUSE OF REPRESENTATIVES OF KUDUS REGENCY

and

THE REGENT OF KUDUS

HAS DECIDED:

To Establish:

REGIONAL REGULATION CONCERNING THE IMPLEMENTATION OF PROTECTION FOR VICTIMS OF GENDER-BASED VIOLENCE AND CHILDREN.
